cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Population to 2150"
message: >-
  If you use this work, please cite the paper rather than the repository.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A 237-country, single-year, two-sex cohort-component population projection to
  2150, built on the United Nations' own inputs, carrying a compositional
  fertility mechanism that a national fertility average cannot represent, and
  reporting the environmental decline that would exactly cancel it.
